<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">RRK50.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAEFESO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Paulo, entumwa ya Kristo Yesu ahabw'okukunda kwa Ruhanga, naabahandiikira imwe abarikwera abari omuri Efeso, kandi abeesigwa omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nimbendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe, na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Ruhanga asiimwe, Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, owaatuhaire emigisha yoona ey'Omwoyo omu myanya y'omu iguru omuri Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yoh 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:27">Efe 5:27</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku yaatutooraniire omuriwe ahabwa rukundo, ensi etakahangirwe, ngu tube abarikwera abataine kamogo omu maisho ge. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Akatutoorana tutakabaireho, ngu tuhindurwe abaana be ahabwa Yesu Kristo, nk'oku yaasiimire omu kukunda kwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />ngu embabazi ze ez'ekitiinisa zisiimwe, ezi yaatuheereire busha omuri Ogwo ou akunda. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Omuri Ogwo tuheebwa okucungurwa ahabw'eshagama ye, okusaasirwa eby'okushiisha byaitu, nk'obutungi bw'embabazi ze oku buri, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ezi yaatusheeshekaizeho. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Rom 16:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akatumanyisa enaama y'okukunda kwe omu bwengye bwona n'okwetegyereza kwona, nk'ebi yaagendereire kworeka omuri Kristo oku biri, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:4">Gal 4:4</ref>. </char></note> ngu atebeekanise ebintu, kandi obunaku ku burihika, abone kuteeranira atyo byona omuriwe nk'Omutwe, eby'omu iguru n'eby'omu nsi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:28">Rom 8:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuriwe naitwe nimwo twahindukiire obuhunguzi, obu twatooranwa tutakabaireho, ahabw'okukunda kw'Ogwo ohikiiriza byona, nk'oku yaasiimire omu naama ye, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />ngu tube ab'okuhimbisisa ekitiinisa kye, itwe abaabandize kwesiga Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:30">Efe 4:30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naimwe, ku mwaherize kuhurira ekigambo ky'amazima, niyo ngiri y'okujunwa kwanyu, mukaikiriza Yesu, mwahamibwa omuriwe n'akamanyiso k'Omwoyo Orikwera owaaraganisiibwe; <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />nigwo mukwato gw'obuhunguzi bwaitu, okuhitysa obu tuributunga, ekitiinisa kye kikasiimwa.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okushabira Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:9">Kol 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo naanye, ku naahuriire aha kwikiriza Mukama waitu Yesu okuri omuriimwe, n'okukunda oku murikukunda abarikwera boona, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />tinkarekaga kubasiimira Ruhanga, n'okubaijuka omu kushaba kwangye, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />nimbashabira ngu: Ruhanga wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, Tataitwe ow'ekitiinisa, abahe omwoyo gw'obwengye n'okushuuruurirwa, mumanye; <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:10">Fil 3:10</ref>. </char></note> amaisho g'emitima yaanyu gamurikirwe, mubone kushoborokyerwa eki mugiraho amatsiko, eki mwayeteirwe, mumanye n'obutungi bw'obuhunguzi bwe obw'ekitiinisa, obu aine omu barikwera, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref>. </char></note> mumanye n'amaani ge agu aine ahariitwe abarikwikiriza, oku gari maingi munonga, nk'okukora kw'amaani g'obushoboorozi bwe oku kuri, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />oku yaahikiririize omuri Kristo, obu yaamuzoora omu bafu, akamushutamya aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo omu iguru, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:18">18</ref>. </char></note> ahaiguru munonga y'obutegyeki bwona n'obushoboorozi bwona n'amaani goona n'obugabe bwona, kandi ahaiguru y'eiziina ryona erigambwa ti mu busingye obu bwonka, kureka n'omu busingye oburiija; <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Zab 8:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi yaamuha okutegyeka byona, yaabita ahansi y'ebigyere bye, yaamuhindura Omutwe gwa byona omu kanisa, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Rom 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:19">Kol 1:19</ref>. </char></note> nigwo mubiri gwe oguhikiirizibwa Ogwo ohikiiriza byona omuri boona.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okujunwa ahabw'embabazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naimwe akabahindura abahuriire, obu mwabaire mufeereire omu bibi n'omu by'okushiisha byanyu, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:12">Efe 6:12</ref>. </char></note> ebi mwabaire mugyenderamu ira nimukuratira emitwarize y'ensi egi, kandi n'okukuratira omukama w'obushoboorozi bw'omu mwanya gw'ahaiguru, nigwo mwoyo ogurikukorera hati omu batarikuhurira. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Kandi naitwe twena tukaba tubarimu, nitukuratira okurigira okubi kw'emibiri yaitu, nitukora ebi emibiri yaitu n'ebiteekateeko byaitu byetenga; kandi ahabw'obuhangwa bwaitu tukaba turi ab'okugirirwa ekiniga nk'abandi boona. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Kwonka Ruhanga ahabw'okuba omutungi w'embabazi, omu kukunda kwe kwingi oku yaatukunzire, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:24">Luk 15:24</ref>. </char></note> n'obu twabaire turi abafu omu by'okushiisha byaitu, akatuhindura abahuriire hamwe na Kristo, (mukajunwa ahabw'embabazi), <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:20">Fil 3:20</ref>. </char></note> yaatuzoora hamwe nawe, yaatushutamya nawe omu myanya y'omu iguru omuri Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />ngu omu busingye oburiija ayorekye obutungi bw'embabazi ze obutarikugyerwa omu birungi ebi yaatukoreire omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu embabazi ze nizo zaabajunire ahabw'okwikiriza; ti habw'okukora kwanyu, kureka n'ekiconco kya Ruhanga, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:29">1 Kor 1:29</ref>. </char></note> ekitararugire mu mirimo, ngu hatagira omuntu weena owaayehimbisa. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba turi ebihangirwe bye, ebi yaahangiire omuri Kristo Yesu okukora emirimo emirungi, ei Ruhanga yaateekateekire ira, ngu tube niyo twagyenderamu.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya n'Abanyamahanga okuteeranwa omusharaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo hariho eki ndikubaijutsya, imwe Abanyamahanga omu buzaare, abu abashazirwe n'engaro emibiri yaabo beeta abatashazirwe; <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:4">Rom 9:4</ref>. </char></note> mwijukye ngu omu biro ebyo mukaba mutaine Kristo, mutaanisiibwe n'oruganda rwa Israeli, mutaine kakwate aha ndagaano y'ebyaraganisiibwe, mutaine matsiko, kandi muri omu nsi mutaine Ruhanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati omuri Kristo Yesu imwe abaabaire bari hare munonga ira, mwiriziibwe haihi ahabw'eshagama ya Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Ogwo niwe busingye bwaitu, owaatuhindwire, itwe ababiri, kuba omwe, akasheenya ekisiika ekyabaire nikitutaanisa, nibwo buzigu, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:17">2 Kor 5:17</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuhayo omubiri gwe kwihaho ebiragiro ebyaragiirwe n'ebyatairweho, ngu abaabaire bari babiri abahangyemu omuntu omwe omusya, abone kureeta atyo obusingye; <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref>. </char></note> kandi atuteerane twembi na Ruhanga omu mubiri gumwe ahabw'omusharaba, ogu yaitsize obuzigu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Yaija, yaabuurira engiri y'obusingye imwe abaabaire bari hare; n'abaabaire bari haihi, nabo yaabagambira obwo busingye; <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />ahakuba ahabw'Ogwo twembi twiriziibwe haihi na Isheboona omu Mwoyo omwe. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:6">Efe 3:6</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo timukiri banyamahanga nari abahinguzi, kureka muri abanyarurembo hamwe n'abarikwera, kandi ab'omu kikaari kya Ruhanga, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />mwombekirwe aha musingi gw'entumwa na baanabi, kandi Kristo Yesu niwe ibaare ery'obuhamizo; <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref>. </char></note> omuriwe ekyombeko kyona nikiteeranwa gye, kikura kiba hekalu erikwera omuri Mukama; <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pet 2:5</ref>. </char></note> naimwe mwombekirwe hamwe omuriwe kuba omwanya gwa Ruhanga ogw'okutuuramu omu Mwoyo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Enaama ya Ruhanga y'okujuna Abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo nyowe Paulo, embohe ahabwa Kristo Yesu, eyaabohirwe ahabwanyu Abanyamahanga, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />ku muraabe mwahuriire oku naakwatsiibwe embabazi za Ruhanga ezi naahairwe ahabwanyu, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:9">Efe 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 1:10">10</ref>. </char></note> oku naamanyisiibwe enaama egyo omu kushuuruurirwa, nk'oku naabandize kubahandiikira omu bigambo bikye, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />naimwe, ku muraabishome, nimwija kwetegyereza oku naamanyire enaama ya Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />etaramanyirwe bantu ira ryona, nk'oku hati eshuuruuriirwe entumwa ze ezirikwera na baanabi omu Mwoyo; <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:19">Efe 2:19</ref>. </char></note> oku Abanyamahanga nabo bari abahunguzi hamwe naitwe, n'engingo z'omubiri gumwe naitwe, kandi abakwataniise naitwe omu byaraganisiibwe omuri Kristo Yesu ahabw'engiri.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:29">Kol 1:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engiri egyo nkahindurwa omuheereza waayo, nk'ekiconco ky'embabazi za Ruhanga oku kiri, eki naahairwe nk'amaani ge oku gakora. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:16">Gal 1:16</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe, n'obu ndaabe ndi muto okukira orikukira obuto omu barikwera boona, nkaheebwa omugisha ogu okubuurira Abanyamahanga obutungi bwa Kristo obutarikwetegyerezibwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />n'okumanyisa abantu boona, bakashoborokyerwa enaama eyaasherekirwe ira ryona omuri Ruhanga owaahangire byona, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom 11:33</ref>. </char></note> ngu omu biro ebi ab'obutegyeki n'obushoboorozi obw'omu iguru babone kumanyisibwa ekanisa obwengye bwa Ruhanga obw'emiringo mingi, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />nk'oku yaateekateekire ira ryona, akabihikiiriza omuri Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:16">Heb 4:16</ref>. </char></note> Omuri Ogwo twine obumanzi n'obwesigye okuhika ahari Ruhanga ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Nikyo ndikubashabira ngu mutahwa amatsiko ahabw'okubonabonesibwa kwangye ahabwanyu, okwo nikyo kitiinisa kyanyu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okushabira aba Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo ntsimba amaju omu maisho ga Isheboona, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ou enganda zoona ez'omu iguru n'ez'omu nsi zeetererwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:11">Kol 1:11</ref>. </char></note> nimmushaba ku abaha okugumibwa n'amaani ahabw'Omwoyo we omu muntu ow'omunda, nk'obutungi bw'ekitiinisa kye oku buri; <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yoh 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:7">Kol 2:7</ref>. </char></note> ngu Kristo abone kutuura omu mitima yaanyu ahabw'okwikiriza; ku muraaheze kutsimba emizi omuri rukundo, mwahamiramu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />mugire amaani ag'okugishoborokyerwa hamwe n'abarikwera boona, mumanye oburaingwa bwayo obw'obukiika, n'obw'oburaingwa, n'obwa bwemi, n'obwa bucuzi, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:3">Kol 2:3</ref>. </char></note> n'okumanyira kimwe okukunda kwa Kristo okurengire munonga okumanya kw'abantu, mubone kwijuzibwa n'okwijura kwona okwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Ogwo orikubaasa kukora ebirikukirira kimwe ebi tushaba nari ebi tuteekateeka, ahabw'amaani agakorera omuriitwe, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />ekitiinisa kibe ekye omu kanisa n'omuri Kristo Yesu okuhitsya obusingye bwona ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:10">Kol 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nyowe, embohe ahabwa Mukama, nimbeeshengyereza mugyendere omu buryo obushemereire okwetwa oku mwayetsirwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref>. </char></note> mwebundaarize n'obucureezi bwona, nimwetwara, nimugumisiririzana omuri rukundo, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />nimwezirika kurinda obumwe bw'Omwoyo, muteerainwe omurunga gw'obusingye. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Hariho omubiri gumwe, n'Omwoyo omwe, nk'oku mwayeteirwe amatsiko gamwe omu kwetwa kwanyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Omukama omwe, okwikiriza kumwe, okubatizibwa kumwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Ruhanga omwe, Tataitwe twena, orikukira boona, okoresa boona, kandi ori omuri boona. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:11">1 Kor 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omuntu weena omuriitwe akaheebwa embabazi nk'ekigyero ky'ekiconco kya Kristo oku kiri. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Zab 68:18</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo kyagambiirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">Ku yaatembire omu iguru, akatwara eminyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">Yaagabira abantu ebiconco.<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:13">Yoh 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Beitu ekigambo eki ngu, Akatemba, nikishoboororwa kita? Tikirikumanyisa ngu, Akabanza kushuuma okuzimu? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ogwo owaashuumire niwe yaatembire, akaza ahaiguru munonga aharikweshumba eiguru ryona, ngu abone kuhikiiriza byona.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Kandi akaha abamwe kuba entumwa, abandi baanabi, abandi ababuurizi b'engiri, abandi kuba abariisa n'abeegyesa, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />ngu abarikwera bateekateekyerwe omurimo gw'okuheereza, babone kwombeka omubiri gwa Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:28">Kol 1:28</ref>. </char></note> okuhitsya obu twena turihika aha kugira obumwe bw'okwikiriza, n'okuhika aha kumanya Omwana wa Ruhanga, okuhitsya obu turiba abantu bakuru, tukahika aha bukuru obw'orugyero rwa Kristo oruhikire, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:9">Heb 13:9</ref>. </char></note> ngu turekye kuguma turi abaana, nituza oku n'oku, nitutwarwa buri muyaga gw'enyegyesa n'oburyarya bw'abantu n'obugobya bwabo n'obwengye bwona bw'okutuhabisa. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Kureka tugambe amazima omu kukunda, omuri byona tukurire omuri Yesu, niwe Mutwe; <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref>. </char></note> omu Mutwe ogwo nimwo omubiri gwona guteeranirwa gye, gukahamibwa hamwe emitsi y'engingo zoona, nk'oku zihwerana, buri rugingo rwaba nirukora eki rwahangiirwe; okwo nikwo omubiri gwona gukura, gukeeyombeka omuri rukundo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu owa ira n'omuntu omusya oku barikushusha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo eki ndikugamba kandi nkahamya omuri Mukama waitu n'eki; murekye kugyenda nk'oku Abanyamahanga bagyenda, nibakuratira ebiteekateeko byabo ebitaine mugasho; <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:14">1 Pet 1:14</ref>. </char></note> obwengye bwabo buri omu mwirima, obutamanya oburi omuribo n'obugangaazi bw'omu mitima yaabo bibataaniise n'amagara agarikuruga ahari Ruhanga; <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />kandi bari nk'ebiti, beetaahize omu by'okurigira okubi, n'omu mururu gw'okukora ebihagaro eby'emiringo yoona. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Kwonka imwe tikwo mwayegire Kristo mutyo, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />ku muraabe niwe mwahuriire, mukeegyesibwa omuriwe nk'oku amazima gaba omuri Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo nibibeegyesa aha by'emicwe yaanyu eya ira, ngu mujuure omuntu waanyu owa ira, orikujunzibwa okwetenga okurikuhabisa, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Rom 12:2</ref>. </char></note> muhindurwe basya omu mwoyo gw'obwengye bwanyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />mujware omuntu ondiijo omusya, owaahangirwe omu nshusha ya Ruhanga omu kuhikiirira n'okwera okw'amazima.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zek 8:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mujuure ebishuba, omuntu weena agambe amazima na mutaahi we; ahabw'okuba turi engingo za bagyenzi baitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:19">Yak 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 1:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Mugire ekiniga, kwonka murekye kushiisha; eizooba rirekye kurenga mukikiine; <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />murekye kuha Sitaane omwanya. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1 Tes 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Omushuma arekye kugaruka kwiba, kureka akore n'amaani, naakoresa emikono ye emirimo mirungi, abone kutunga eby'okuha abooro. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref>, <ref loc="COL 3:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Omu kanwa kaanyu hatarirugamu ekigambo kyona ekibi; kureka mugambe ebirungi ebirikubaasa kukuza abantu ahu bishemereire kugambirwa, bibone kuhaisa abarikubihurira omugisha. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mutarigwisa kubi Omwoyo Orikwera wa Ruhanga, owaabateereirweho kuba akamanyiso okuhitsya aha kiro ky'okucungurirwaho. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Obushaarizi bwona n'ekiniga n'okuguubwa kubi n'oruyombo n'okujumiirana, hamwe n'eihari ryona biihwe omuriimwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:22-35">Mat 18:22-35</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref>, <ref loc="COL 3:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Mukorerane gye, mugirirane embabazi, kandi musaasirane, nk'oku Ruhanga yaabasaasiire omuri Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okugyendera omu mwirima, n'okugyendera omu mushana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo mukuratire Ruhanga nk'abaana abarikukundwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kur 29:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mugyendere omu kukunda nk'oku Kristo yaatukunzire, akeehayo ahabwaitu okuba empongano n'ekitambo ahari Ruhanga, omugaju ogurikutaamirana. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Kwonka obushambani n'ekihagaro kyona n'okwetenga kwona bitarigambwaho omuriimwe, mube nk'oku abarikwera bashemereire kuba. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:8">Kol 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Omu kugamba kwanyu murekye kugamba ebirikwitsa enshoni n'eby'obushema n'eby'okushetsya ebitahikire; kureka musiima Ruhanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">1 Kor 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 6:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eki mukumanyire kimwe, ngu tihariho mushambani n'obu yaakuba okora ebihagaro n'obu yaakuba omwetengi, niwe oramya ebishushani, oriheebwa omugabo omu bukama bwa Kristo na Ruhanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Hatagira omuntu owaababeihabeihesa ebigambo ebitaine mugasho; ahabw'okuba ebibi ebyo nibyo bireeta ekiniga kya Ruhanga aha batarikuhurira. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo mutarikwatanisa nabo; <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:36">Yoh 12:36</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ira mukaba muri omwirima, kwonka hati muri omushana omuri Mukama; mugume mugyende nk'abaana b'omushana; <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />ahabw'okuba ebyana by'omushana bireeberwa omu burungi bwona n'omu kuhikiirira n'omu mazima; <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Rom 12:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi mwetegyereze ebirikusiimwa Mukama. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mutarikwatanisa n'emirimo y'omwirima etarikwana; kureka mugihane. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:24">Rom 1:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ebi abo bakorera omu mubonano, nangwa n'okubigambaho kwonka, n'eky'enshoni. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:20">Yoh 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka byona, ku byakirwa omushana, bireebwa; ahakuba kyona ekyakirwa omushana kikareebwa, kiba omushana; <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />nikyo kirikugambirwa ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Sisiimuka, iwe ogwejegyeire, ozookye omu bafu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Kristo akwakire.<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde, mumanye oku murikugyenda, mutagyenda nk'abataine bwengye, kureka nk'abanyabwengye, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />mutafiisa busha omwanya, ahakuba ebiro ebi ni bibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Rom 12:2</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mutaba abashema, kureka mumanye buzima ebi Mukama waitu arikwenda. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34">Luk 21:34</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:1">Enf 20:1</ref>. </char></note> Mutarisinda viinyo erimu okujagarara, kureka mwijure Omwoyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Mugambirane zaaburi n'ebyeshongoro n'ebyevugo eby'Omwoyo, nimweshongorera Mukama n'emitima yaanyu yoona, nimuteera enanga, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:17">Kol 3:17</ref>. </char></note> nimusiima Ruhanga Isheboona obutoosha ahabwa byona omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:5">1 Pet 5:5</ref>. </char></note> nimworoberana ahabw'okutiina Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize emirungi y'abashaija n'abakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abakazi, mworobere baabaroimwe nk'oku mworobera Mukama. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:3">1 Kor 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omushaija niwe mutwe gw'omukazi, nk'oku Kristo ari Omutwe gw'ekanisa, omubiri gwe; kandi niwe Mujuni waayo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Nk'oku ekanisa eyorobera Kristo, n'abakazi babe nikwo baayorobera abashaija baabo omuri byona. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Kandi imwe abashaija, mukunde abakazi baanyu, nk'oku Kristo yaakunzire ekanisa, akeehayo ahabwayo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit 3:5</ref>. </char></note> ngu agyeeze, aherize kugishemeza ahabw'okugyogyesa amaizi n'Ekigambo kye; <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />ngu ekanisa egyo ebone kumurikwa omu maisho ge eri ey'ekitiinisa, etaine ibara n'obu gwakuba omufunya, nari ekintu kyona ekirikushusha kityo, kureka ebe erikwera etaine kamogo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Nikwo n'abashaija bashemereire kukunda abakazi baabo nk'emibiri yaabo bonka. Okunda omukazi we, biri ayekunzire; <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />ahakuba tihariho muntu oyanga omubiri gwe, kureka aguriisa, agucuma, nk'oku Kristo agira ekanisa; <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:15">1 Kor 6:15</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba turi engingo z'omubiri gwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Nikyo omushaija atsigiraho ishe na nyina, akateeranwa n'omukazi we, bombi bakaba omubiri gumwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:7">Kush 19:7</ref>. </char></note> Egi n'enaama nkuru; kwonka nyowe ningigyeranisa ahari Kristo n'ekanisa. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, omuntu weena omuriimwe akunde omukazi we, nk'oku ayekunda; n'omukazi nawe ashemereire kutiina iba.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize mirungi y'amaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20-4:1">Kol 3:20—4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana, mworobere abazaire baanyu omuri Mukama, ahakuba nikyo kihikire. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Tiina sho na nyoko; (ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'okubanza ekirimu okuraganisibwa) <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />obone kuba gye, okahangaara omu nsi. <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:20-25">Bir 6:20-25</ref>. </char></note> Naimwe baishebo, murekye kugwisa kubi abaana baanyu, kureka mubarere, nimubategyeka gye, kandi nimubeegyeseza omuri Mukama.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Imwe abahuuku, mworobere bakama baanyu ab'omu nsi, nk'abarikworobera Kristo, mubatiine nimutetema n'omutima ogutaine buryarya. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mutabakorera ahabw'okureebwa, nk'abarikwenda kusiimwa abantu, kureka nk'abahuuku ba Kristo abakora ebi Ruhanga akunda, nimukora mwihire aha mutima. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mubakorere n'omutima murungi, nk'abarikukorera Mukama, ti nk'abarikukorera abantu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Kor 5:10</ref>. </char></note> nimumanya ngu ekirungi kyona eki omuntu akora, aryakiihurwa Mukama, yaaba muhuuku nari ow'obusingye. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:7">2 Bus 19:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi imwe bakama baabo, naimwe mube nikwo mwabatwaza, murekye kubatiinisa, nimumanya ngu Mukama waanyu mwembi ari omu iguru, kandi tashoroora mu bantu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okurwanisa by'Abakristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:13">1 Kor 16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eky'aha muheru, mube abahamire omuri Mukama n'omubushoboorozi bw'amaani ge. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mujware eby'okurwanisa byona ebya Ruhanga, mubone kwemerera mutasingwirwe bugobya bwa Sitaane. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba titurikufukaana n'abaine omubiri n'eshagama, kureka niturwana n'ebirikutegyeka n'ebiine obushoboorozi n'ebirikutwara ensi egi omu busingye obu obw'omwirima, kandi niturwana n'amahe g'emyoyo emibi ey'omu myanya y'omu iguru. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo mukwate eby'okurwanisa byona ebya Ruhanga, mubone kuguma aha izooba ribi; kandi, ku muriheza kukora byona, mwemerere muhamire. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ekyo mwemerere, mwezirikire amazima omunda nk'orukoba, mujwaire eky'okuhikiirira nk'ekyoma ky'okwekingiza omu kifuba, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref>. </char></note> mujwaire enkaito ez'okweteekateeka kugamba engiri y'obusingye; <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:4">1 Yoh 5:4</ref>. </char></note> kandi ahari ebyo byona mukwatireho engabo y'okwikiriza, ei murikubaasa kuraarisa emyambi y'omuriro yoona ey'Omubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:12">Heb 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mujware enkofiira ey'okujunwa, na rurara y'Omwoyo, nikyo kigambo kya Ruhanga; <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:2">Kol 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:3">3</ref>. </char></note> mushabire omu Mwoyo obutoosha omu kushaba kw'emiringo yoona n'okweshengyereza, nimubyezirika n'okugumisiriza kwona, nimushabira abarikwera boona; <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />kandi naanye munshabire, mbone kuheebwa okugamba n'obumanzi, hoona ahi ndyashamiza akanwa kangye okumanyisa enaama y'engiri, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:20">2 Kor 5:20</ref>. </char></note> ei ndi entumwa yaayo omu nkomo, ngigambe n'obumanzi, nk'oku kinshemereire.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Kandi Tukiko, ow'eishe-emwe orikukundwa, omuheereza omwesigwa omuri Mukama, aryabateekyerereza byona, mubone kumanya ebyangye n'ebi ndikukora. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo naamubatumiraho ku mumanya nk'oku turi, kandi ngu agumye emitima yaanyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Obusingye bugume n'ab'eishe-emwe, n'okukunda hamwe n'okwikiriza ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Isheboona na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">1 Pet 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Embabazi zibe ahari boona abarikukunda Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo okukunda okutahwaho.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>